# A per-test permissions option belongs to the registration and the lane.
rules:
--- before
Deno.test({
  name: "needs net",
  permissions: { net: true },
  fn: () => {},
});
--- after
Deno.test({
  name: "needs net",
  permissions: { net: true },
  fn: () => {},
});
--- findings
hand-review test-permissions 3
